more primitive Gaussian-law premise used in Hansen's whitening argument. -/
theorem wishartLaw_congr_map_of_iidMatrixGaussianLaw_map
    {q : Type*} [Fintype q] [DecidableEq q]
    (Sigma : Matrix m m ℝ) (Sigma' : Matrix q q ℝ)
    (T : Matrix m q ℝ)
    (hYmap : (iidMatrixGaussianLaw (n := n) (m := m) (0 : m → ℝ) Sigma).map
