`n(Ȳ-μ₀)'Σ⁻¹(Ȳ-μ₀) ∼ χ²_m` for iid `N(μ₀,Σ)` rows. -/
theorem hotellingMeanChiSqComponent_hasLaw_chiSquared_of_iid_normal_rows
    [IsProbabilityMeasure μ] [Nonempty n]
    (Y : Ω → Matrix n m ℝ)
    (μ0 : m → ℝ) {Sigma : Matrix m m ℝ} (hSigma : Sigma.PosDef)
